cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EIPF in your research or project, please cite this specification."
title: "EIPF - Electric Interactive Publications Format"
abstract: >-
  A vendor-neutral, IP-neutral specification for interactive digital
  publications, defining a ZIP-based three-layer container format
  (Series/Album/Entry), the scene-entry content model, an embedded
  renderer IPC protocol, and optional signature/device/encryption
  security attributes.
version: 2.0.1-beta1
date-released: 2026-08-09
license: CC0-1.0
keywords:
  - digital publication
  - specification
  - interactive fiction
  - eipf
  - scenario
